    {
      "id": "s05",
      "type": "rubric",
      "text": "Abluit et extergit digitos, ac sumit ablutionem: extergit os et Calicem, quem, plicato Corporali, operit et collocat in Altari ut prius: deinde prosequitur Missam.",
      "narrative": {
        "pl": "Kapłan obmywa i wyciera palce, spożywa ablucję, ociera usta i kielich, składa korporał, nakrywa kielich, stawia go na ołtarzu i kontynuuje Mszę.",
        "en": "The priest washes and dries his fingers, consumes the ablution, wipes his mouth and the chalice, folds the corporal, covers the chalice, replaces it on the altar, and then continues the Mass."
      }
